- [ ] **(Eng/Ops) P0** **Outbound mail is failing**: on 2026-11-17 every buyer introduction of the 8 live prospects failed with "Connection lost" (10 `RESOLVE_EXCEPTION` gates pending, `CALLBACK_FAILED`); no buyer has been contacted, one prospect is 7 days old. Fix the SMTP / gateway connection (1.3), then resend from each prospect (Contact next buyers) — the candidates from before the fix carry no `send_error`, so check them by hand.
